# Only what the image is built from. Everything else stays out of the build: .env above
# all, which holds the real Gemini key, and also .venv, the caches, tests/ and evals/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!alembic.ini
!migrations/

# Not even inside the folders above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
